      <section class="statement-band section-pad reveal">
        <div class="container statement-grid">
          <p class="eyebrow coral-text">Less mental juggling</p>
          <h2>Everything you need to keep moving, <em>all in one place.</em></h2>
          <p>Study Buddy brings the moving pieces of university life together, then gives you a clear next step.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="features section-pad" id="features">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Built around your real week</p><h2>Make room for the work<br /><em>that matters.</em></h2></div>
          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature-card feature-coral reveal"><span class="feature-number">01</span><div class="feature-icon">▤</div><h3>Organise your subjects</h3><p>Keep your units and subject codes together, so nothing important gets lost in a dozen different places.</p><a href="#preview" class="arrow-link">See your subjects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            <article class="feature-card feature-saffron reveal reveal-delay-1"><span class="feature-number">02</span><div class="feature-icon">✓</div><h3>Track tasks & deadlines</h3><p>Record assignments, assessments, revision, priority, and estimated effort before they become last-minute stress.</p><a href="#preview" class="arrow-link">Track the details <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            <article class="feature-card feature-sage reveal reveal-delay-2"><span class="feature-number">03</span><div class="feature-icon">◷</div><h3>Plan around your time</h3><p>Tell Study Buddy when you are actually free—weeknights, weekends, or the small gaps in between.</p><a href="#preview" class="arrow-link">Make time visible <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            <article class="feature-card feature-ink reveal reveal-delay-3"><span class="feature-number">04</span><div class="feature-icon">✦</div><h3>Generate your study plan</h3><p>Study Buddy combines your subjects, deadlines, priorities, effort, and availability into a plan that makes sense.</p><a href="#preview" class="arrow-link">Generate your week <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="how-it-works section-pad" id="how-it-works">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="how-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">Four simple steps</p><h2>From scattered to <em>sorted.</em></h2></div><p>Start with what you already know. Study Buddy does the organising so you can focus on doing.</p></div>
          <ol class="steps-list">
            <li class="step reveal"><span class="step-number">01</span><div class="step-mark">+</div><div><h3>Add your subjects</h3><p>Add the units and subjects you are studying this semester.</p></div></li>
            <li class="step reveal reveal-delay-1"><span class="step-number">02</span><div class="step-mark">✓</div><div><h3>Add tasks & deadlines</h3><p>Record assignments, assessments, revision tasks, and due dates.</p></div></li>
            <li class="step reveal reveal-delay-2"><span class="step-number">03</span><div class="step-mark">◷</div><div><h3>Set your available time</h3><p>Choose when you are actually free to study across your week.</p></div></li>
            <li class="step reveal reveal-delay-3"><span class="step-number">04</span><div class="step-mark">✦</div><div><h3>Generate your study plan</h3><p>Get a weekly schedule built around your life—not an imaginary one.</p></div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="product-preview section-pad" id="preview">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro centered reveal"><p class="eyebrow">A clearer week, at a glance</p><h2>Your plan, without<br /><em>the guesswork.</em></h2><p>See what is next, what is open, and how close you are to your goals.</p></div>
          <div class="app-window reveal">
            <aside class="app-sidebar">
              <a href="#home" class="app-brand"><span class="brand-mark">✦</span><strong>Study<span>Buddy</span></strong></a>
              <nav aria-label="Plan preview navigation">
                <a class="is-active" href="#preview"><span>▦</span> Plan</a><a href="#preview"><span>◈</span> Subjects</a><a href="#preview"><span>✓</span> Tasks</a><a href="#preview"><span>◷</span> Availability</a>
              </nav>
              <div class="availability-mini"><p class="mini-label">Your availability</p><strong>Mon–Thu <span>6–9 PM</span></strong><strong>Weekend <span>10 AM–2 PM</span></strong><a href="#get-started">Edit times ↗</a></div>
            </aside>
            <div class="app-main">
              <div class="app-topbar"><div><p class="mini-label">Monday, 14 October 2026</p><h3>Your study plan <span class="status-dot"></span></h3></div><button class="avatar">MS</button></div>
              <div class="subject-strip"><span class="mini-label">Your subjects</span><div class="subject-chip chip-coral"><i></i>SIT725</div><div class="subject-chip chip-saffron"><i></i>SIT789</div><div class="subject-chip chip-sage"><i></i>SIT728</div></div>
              <div class="calendar-wrap">
                <div class="calendar-top"><div><p class="mini-label">This week</p><strong>14 – 20 October</strong></div><button class="outline-button js-plan-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Show details <span>↓</span></button></div>
                <div class="calendar-grid">
                  <div class="calendar-time-column"><span></span><span>5 PM</span><span>6 PM</span><span>7 PM</span><span>8 PM</span><span>9 PM</span></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>MON <small>14</small></b><div class="calendar-event coral-event" style="top:28%"><strong>SIT725</strong><span>Assignment</span><small>6:00–7:30 PM</small></div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>TUE <small>15</small></b><div class="calendar-event saffron-event" style="top:45%"><strong>SIT789</strong><span>Revision</span><small>7:00–8:30 PM</small></div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>WED <small>16</small></b><div class="calendar-event sage-event" style="top:18%"><strong>SIT728</strong><span>Draft</span><small>5:00–6:00 PM</small></div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>THU <small>17</small></b><div class="calendar-event ink-event" style="top:38%"><strong>SIT789</strong><span>Lab prep</span><small>6:30–8:00 PM</small></div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>FRI <small>18</small></b><div class="calendar-open" style="top:25%">Free time</div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>SAT <small>19</small></b><div class="calendar-open" style="top:55%">Open</div></div>
                  <div class="calendar-day"><b>SUN <small>20</small></b><div class="calendar-open" style="top:32%">Open</div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="plan-detail" aria-hidden="true"><strong>Plan note</strong><span>Two focused blocks and a protected reset window keep this week achievable.</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="app-summary"><div class="summary-card progress-summary"><div><p class="mini-label">Weekly progress</p><strong>78%</strong><span>3h 45m of 8h planned</span></div><div class="ring-progress"><span>78</span></div></div><div class="summary-card deadline-summary"><p class="mini-label">Next deadline</p><strong>SIT728 <span>· Report draft</span></strong><p>Friday · 2 days remaining</p><div class="deadline-line"><span></span></div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="comparison section-pad">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro centered reveal"><p class="eyebrow">A better way to study</p><h2>Less time planning.<br /><em>More time studying.</em></h2></div>
          <div class="comparison-grid">
            <div class="comparison-side without reveal"><div class="comparison-title"><span class="x-mark">×</span><h3>Without a plan</h3><span class="mood-label">Scattered</span></div><div class="scatter-note note-email"><b>Email</b><span>SIT728 report — due sometime Friday?</span></div><div class="scatter-note note-notes"><b>Notes</b><span>Finish SIT725 testing section</span></div><div class="scatter-note note-sticky"><b>Sticky note</b><span>SIT789 revision before lab</span></div><div class="scatter-note note-memory"><b>Memory</b><span>Shift Thursday — no study?</span></div></div>
            <div class="comparison-divider" aria-hidden="true"><span>→</span></div>
            <div class="comparison-side with reveal reveal-delay-1"><div class="comparison-title"><span class="check-mark">✓</span><h3>With Study Buddy</h3><span class="mood-label">Sorted</span></div><div class="sorted-list"><div><span class="subject-dot dot-coral"></span><strong>SIT725</strong><span>Assignment</span><time>Mon · 6:00–7:30</time></div><div><span class="subject-dot dot-saffron"></span><strong>SIT789</strong><span>Revision</span><time>Tue · 7:00–8:30</time></div><div><span class="subject-dot dot-sage"></span><strong>SIT728</strong><span>Draft</span><time>Wed · 5:00–6:00</time></div><div><span class="subject-dot dot-ink"></span><strong>SIT789</strong><span>Lab prep</span><time>Thu · 6:30–8:00</time></div></div><div class="planned-total"><span>Planned this week</span><strong>8h 30m</strong></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

